fonts-agave

Agave is a fixed-width outline programming font by type agaric.

This SlackBuild installs the four production TrueType fonts:

  * Agave-Regular.ttf
  * Agave-Bold.ttf
  * Agave-Regular-slashed.ttf
  * Agave-Bold-slashed.ttf

The fonts are installed in /usr/share/fonts/TTF.

The incomplete Italic and Bold Italic development fonts, as well as the
unhinted development fonts, are not installed. The package uses the
prebuilt fonts supplied by upstream because the project does not provide
an automated build system; its documented FontForge and ttfautohint
build process is manual.

The font files are licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
Upstream documentation and promotional files remain under the MIT
License. Both licenses are installed in /usr/doc/fonts-agave-38.
